### ============================================================================
### Dexpert Payment Webhook - Local Test Requests
### Local Server: http://localhost:5000
### Production Server: https://admin.freshwayz.dexpertsystems.com
### ============================================================================

### 1. Test Unrecognized / Pending Status (The exact payload you mentioned)
### Expected outcome: "unrecognized_status" (HTTP 200, DB payment remains PENDING)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/payments/webhook/dexpert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transaction_id": "TXNF85F7B1FA9AA",
  "amount": "800.00",
  "status": "PENDING"
}


### 2. Test Real Payment Success (What Dexpert sends when customer pays)
### Expected outcome: "marked_success", generates receipt number, marks Order as PAID
POST http://localhost:5000/api/payments/webhook/dexpert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transaction_id": "TXNF85F7B1FA9AA",
  "amount": "800.00",
  "status": "success",
  "pg_transt_id": "DEX_PG_12345678"
}


### 3. Test Idempotency (Send the exact same success payload a 2nd time)
### Expected outcome: "already_final" (HTTP 200, no duplicate receipt or double processing)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/payments/webhook/dexpert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transaction_id": "TXNF85F7B1FA9AA",
  "amount": "800.00",
  "status": "success"
}


### 4. Test Amount Mismatch Tamper Protection
### Expected outcome: "amount_mismatch" (Payment will NOT be approved)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/payments/webhook/dexpert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transaction_id": "TXNF85F7B1FA9AA",
  "amount": "500.00",
  "status": "success"
}


### 5. Test Non-existent Transaction
### Expected outcome: "unknown_transaction"
POST http://localhost:5000/api/payments/webhook/dexpert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transaction_id": "TXN_DOES_NOT_EXIST",
  "amount": "800.00",
  "status": "success"
}
